5,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,We need to decide our destination. I think we should look into how the environment affects our group dynamic and our personal space.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"I agree, dear. I also think we should be very clear about how the costs are handled so everyone feels it is fair.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Minato,,I want to know about the bathrooms and when we have to eat. Those things make a big difference for me.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I am concerned about the travel time. I would like to know how much of our week is spent just getting there.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Midori,,I would feel much better if we knew the total cost upfront. I don't like surprises with the bill at the end.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Jonathan, that makes sense. Maybe we should check the ferry and train times to compare the options.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Midori, perhaps we can look at all-in rates versus separate meals to see which is more transparent.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Minato,,Can we check the room arrangements too? I wonder if we all have to sleep in one room.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"Yes, and the local transport once we arrive. I don't want to spend the whole trip waiting for buses.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Midori,,I think looking at what rooms cost last time would help us set a realistic budget.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,I'll look into the shared-house experience from before. I want to see if that's why we felt crowded or lonely.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Shizue,,I will investigate the pricing of those offshore houses to see if the billing is simpler.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Minato,,I'll check the bathing hours and the bathroom provisions.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,"I'll take the ferry and train times, and the local transport options.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Midori,,I'll look into the all-in rates and the valley inn versus urban bed pricing.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
