35,2,1,talk,Mizuki,,"It seems last year we were too separate, but in a shared house, there's no place to be alone. We need a balance.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Shizue,,"The offshore houses are quite cheap per head, and renting a whole building means one even bill for everyone.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Minato,,The inn has strict mealtimes and we'd all be on futons in one room. The island house only has one bathroom.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,"The train to the valley is fast, but the ferry takes two whole days of our trip. City transport is the easiest.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Midori,,All-in rates mean light eaters pay the same as big eaters. City beds are expensive and meals are extra.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Minato, does the idea of one room at an inn bother you, or is the one bathroom on the island worse?","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Midori, if we rent a whole house, the cost is divided evenly, which avoids the discrepancies we had last time.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Minato,,One bathroom for all of us sounds difficult. But the inn's schedule is very strict.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Mizuki, if we go to the city, we have the most freedom and the least travel stress.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Midori,,"The valley inn is a predictable price, but the city could become very expensive depending on what we do.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Mizuki,,The city allows us to be together but also gives us space to wander. The island might be too crowded.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Shizue,,"The island house is the most equitable for payment, but I worry about the comfort for Minato.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Minato,,"I think I would prefer a city room with a door, even if it means we aren't always together.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,I strongly prefer the train or the city. Losing two days to a ferry is too much.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Midori,,"I like the predictability of the inn, but I don't want anyone to feel uncomfortable with the sleeping arrangements.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
