60,3,1,talk,Mizuki,,"Option C gives us the best balance of social time and personal space, and it avoids the ""crowded"" feeling.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Shizue,,"Option B is the fairest for the wallet, but Option A is a lovely middle ground for the group.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Minato,,I vote for Option C. Having my own room and no strict mealtimes would make me much happier.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Jonathan,,I vote for Option C. The travel is efficient and I won't spend the holiday waiting for ferries.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Midori,,"I'm torn, but if the city is too expensive, I'd prefer Option A for the fixed cost.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Midori, we can set a budget for the city. It's better than being miserable in a shared room.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Shizue,,"If the others prefer the city, I am happy to go. Harmony is more important than the billing method.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Minato,,"@Shizue, thank you. I really don't think I can do the one-bathroom island house.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Jonathan,,Option A's bus schedule is also a bit restrictive. Option C is the most logical choice.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Midori,,"I suppose if we agree on a budget beforehand, Option C could work.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Mizuki,,I vote for Option C.,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Shizue,,"I will vote for Option C as well, for the sake of the group's comfort.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Minato,,Option C for me.,"{""words"":4,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Jonathan,,Option C.,"{""words"":2,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Midori,,"I'll go with Option C too, as long as we plan the costs.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
